      "statement": "AdminConfig covers the deployment's soft customizations (signupsEnabled, siteName/logo, instanceInstructions, announcement, banner, accentColor, disabledResources, disabledGatekeepers, ambientGatekeeperModes, formats), defaults everything to enabled with the admin UI opting out, and deliberately excludes authentication/authorization config (AUTH_GATEKEEPERS, DISABLE_PASSWORD_AUTH) which stays env-var driven so a compromised admin session cannot change it.",
