      "statement": "Every config read backfills missing fields from DEFAULT_ADMIN_CONFIG (a config persisted before a field existed reads as the default, not undefined), and every mutation funnels through #mutateAdminConfig which serializes the full read-modify-write on adminConfigMutationTail so concurrent setters cannot lose updates, rolling DO storage back if the KV mirror write fails.",
