      "statement": "Nothing wakes on deploy: the first /api request a fresh deployment serves triggers ensureFormatBlueprintsInstalled via ctx.waitUntil, guarded by an isolate-level flag that is cleared on failure or partial completion so the next request retries — the DO coalesces concurrent callers onto one install.",
