      "id": "claim_536d1ab6992f4d168500a74a102bf946",
      "statement": "The format-blueprint install compares the shipped manifest fingerprint against the installedFormatBlueprints stamp, installs changed archives into KV+R2, mirrors them into the featured collection, and stamps the version ONLY when the whole manifest is live — a partial install resolves false so the caller retries, since recording a partial install as complete would strand the failed entries until the manifest changed again.",
